1
00:00:07,841 --> 00:00:09,092
Hey...

2
00:00:10,051 --> 00:00:11,302
Have you
been waiting long?

3
00:00:23,606 --> 00:00:24,441
Can we

4
00:00:25,775 --> 00:00:27,402
stop waiting?

5
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:48,214
It's been a while.

6
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:53,178
It's been a while.

7
00:01:13,740 --> 00:01:15,658
Remember this key?

8
00:01:21,414 --> 00:01:22,874
It unlocks

9
00:01:23,583 --> 00:01:25,168
the deepest secrets

10
00:01:25,585 --> 00:01:27,087
we keep inside.

11
00:01:38,723 --> 00:01:39,891
After all this time,

12
00:01:40,892 --> 00:01:42,852
secrets change.

13
00:01:44,604 --> 00:01:45,855
That's good.

14
00:01:46,314 --> 00:01:47,816
It really hits.

15
00:02:21,099 --> 00:02:22,433
When'd you start
smoking again?

16
00:02:27,730 --> 00:02:30,650
When I'm stuck writing.

17
00:02:32,527 --> 00:02:33,653
That hard, huh?

18
00:02:36,156 --> 00:02:38,241
You're just writing
about our past.

19
00:02:47,292 --> 00:02:48,459
Am I?

20
00:02:49,294 --> 00:02:50,545
This scene...

21
00:02:52,046 --> 00:02:54,299
I made it all up.

22
00:02:58,511 --> 00:03:00,805
You've got
a terrible imagination.

23
00:03:08,730 --> 00:03:10,481
If I did,

24
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:17,614
January wouldn't be
so irresistible.

25
00:03:31,961 --> 00:03:34,881
Can't wait to see
what you dream up for us.

26
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:36,484
Right now,

27
00:04:36,484 --> 00:04:39,112
Phil and January's storyline
is getting the most buzz.

28
00:04:39,529 --> 00:04:40,446
Cole,

29
00:04:40,446 --> 00:04:43,074
I want bigger,
better story beats.

30
00:04:43,074 --> 00:04:44,742
Build on that storyline.

31
00:04:45,243 --> 00:04:47,829
Candy, go through
all the comments.

32
00:04:47,829 --> 00:04:50,665
I want to know what viewers
want to see next.

33
00:04:52,458 --> 00:04:55,962
Okay. We'll figure out
Episode 2 tomorrow.

34
00:05:09,350 --> 00:05:10,143
Hi!

35
00:05:11,102 --> 00:05:11,894
Hello.

36
00:05:13,396 --> 00:05:14,188
Hi.

37
00:05:14,731 --> 00:05:16,441
We haven't met before.

38
00:05:17,150 --> 00:05:17,984
I'm Andy.

39
00:05:19,569 --> 00:05:20,250
Jan.

40
00:05:21,208 --> 00:05:21,500
Nice to meet you.

41
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:23,406
Of course I know
who you are.

42
00:05:23,406 --> 00:05:26,367
You and Phil
have amazing chemistry.

43
00:05:28,036 --> 00:05:29,078
Thanks.

44
00:05:29,078 --> 00:05:30,288
No problem.

45
00:05:30,288 --> 00:05:31,789
I mean it.

46
00:05:38,921 --> 00:05:40,173
Oh!

47
00:05:40,173 --> 00:05:42,383
I heard you get
low blood sugar.

48
00:05:42,383 --> 00:05:44,052
So I brought this for you.

49
00:05:53,061 --> 00:05:54,771
Why'd you walk

50
00:05:55,605 --> 00:05:58,358
all the way over here
just to hand it to me?

51
00:05:59,317 --> 00:06:00,151
Did I?

52
00:06:00,860 --> 00:06:01,778
Didn't you?

53
00:06:02,111 --> 00:06:03,488
Was it that obvious?

54
00:06:04,489 --> 00:06:05,907
Haha.

55
00:06:09,410 --> 00:06:12,038
My left side
looks better on camera.

56
00:06:18,336 --> 00:06:21,422
Hahaha.

57
00:06:29,597 --> 00:06:32,266
Guys, we've got
a challenge.

58
00:06:35,353 --> 00:06:37,939
I found this card
on the table.

59
00:06:37,939 --> 00:06:40,024
I think it's
our next challenge.

60
00:06:44,779 --> 00:06:47,156
Inside are stories
from each of the guys

61
00:06:47,156 --> 00:06:50,660
about the most romantic thing
they've ever done.

62
00:06:51,369 --> 00:06:52,453
Open the box

63
00:06:52,453 --> 00:06:55,456
and get to know
each other's romantic side.

64
00:06:56,125 --> 00:06:57,333
Open it!

65
00:07:03,798 --> 00:07:07,343
I've always been
afraid of love

66
00:07:07,343 --> 00:07:10,930
until someone came along
with a key

67
00:07:11,889 --> 00:07:13,724
and unlocked my heart.

68
00:07:15,143 --> 00:07:19,439
They saw every secret
I'd been hiding.

69
00:07:19,439 --> 00:07:20,731
That's when I realized

70
00:07:21,858 --> 00:07:23,860
I loved so fiercely

71
00:07:24,569 --> 00:07:27,905
because I wanted
to be loved.

72
00:07:33,995 --> 00:07:36,873
Love with your whole heart.

73
00:07:37,582 --> 00:07:38,958
If she loves me,

74
00:07:38,958 --> 00:07:40,251
I'll love her back.

75
00:07:40,501 --> 00:07:42,003
If she hates me,

76
00:07:42,712 --> 00:07:44,338
I'll love her even more.

77
00:08:04,650 --> 00:08:06,110
I'll protect you.

78
00:08:11,908 --> 00:08:13,284
Lisa loved it.

79
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,043
What's that mean?

80
00:08:24,879 --> 00:08:25,880
What do you mean?

81
00:08:27,215 --> 00:08:29,217
So you think
I'm a coward, huh?

82
00:08:31,219 --> 00:08:33,429
I was just writing.

83
00:08:34,013 --> 00:08:36,390
This isn't just a script.

84
00:08:41,103 --> 00:08:42,813
It is a script.

85
00:08:42,813 --> 00:08:44,607
Did you ever think
about how I felt?

86
00:08:49,195 --> 00:08:50,404
Look at me!

87
00:08:52,949 --> 00:08:54,784
Sure, you've got
a great imagination.

88
00:08:54,784 --> 00:08:56,786
You've got plenty
of scripts to write.

89
00:08:56,786 --> 00:08:58,913
When did you become
this kind of person?

90
00:09:00,164 --> 00:09:01,832
You're selfish,
you know that?

91
00:09:03,751 --> 00:09:05,378
Quit acting like
you're some hero!

92
00:09:05,378 --> 00:09:07,588
You got famous
off the hype, too.

93
00:09:07,588 --> 00:09:09,048
The dream guy, huh?

94
00:09:10,591 --> 00:09:12,677
Music alone
wouldn't make you famous!

95
00:09:20,685 --> 00:09:21,978
You want clout?

96
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,817
You want clout, huh?

97
00:09:27,817 --> 00:09:29,026
I'll give you that.

98
00:09:53,134 --> 00:09:54,260
Chen Yaowei.

99
00:10:02,435 --> 00:10:03,936
You lose your key
every time.

100
00:10:05,062 --> 00:10:07,189
This is the spare.

101
00:10:07,189 --> 00:10:08,274
I'll hang on to it.

102
00:10:12,945 --> 00:10:14,947
In case you ever
lock yourself out

103
00:10:19,785 --> 00:10:21,203
or lose your key,

104
00:10:25,750 --> 00:10:27,960
I'll still have the spare.
